---@field resource_url_path_group string URL path group used to aggregate similar resources.
---@field server_validated_cache_count number Number of cached requests revalidated by the server with a 304 response.
---@field timing_breakdown datadog.v2.AggregatedResourceTimingBreakdown
---@field total_requests number Total number of requests for this resource across all sampled views.
---@field views_with_resource number Number of sampled view instances that loaded this resource.

