---Items Metadata-only capture adds, each listed once. An item requires the items whose information it already reveals: `tool_output_size`, `tool_names` and `conversation_shape` require `tool_usage`, and `input_size_by_role` requires `tool_output_size`. A set that leaves out a required item is rejected. When several Metadata-only overrides match a request, it gets only the items all of them select.
---@alias datadog.v2.AiGatewayMetadataCapture (datadog.v2.AiGatewayMetadataCaptureItem|string)[]

---An item Metadata-only capture can add to LLM Observability spans. Each is structure or a number, never conversation text. `tool_usage` adds tool call and result counts; `tool_output_size` adds estimated tool output tokens, total and average; `tool_names` adds each tool call and result with its name, ID and type; `conversation_shape` adds every message with its role and no text; `input_size_by_role` adds estimated input tokens per role; `available_tools` adds the names of the tools the request offered; `generation_settings` adds numeric and enumerated settings such as temperature and the finish reason.
---@alias datadog.v2.AiGatewayMetadataCaptureItem "tool_usage"|"tool_output_size"|"tool_names"|"conversation_shape"|"input_size_by_role"|"available_tools"|"generation_settings"

