---A single dashboard usage record.
---@class datadog.v2.DashboardUsage
---@field attributes datadog.v2.DashboardUsageAttributes
---@field id string The dashboard ID.
---@field type datadog.v2.DashboardUsageType

---Usage statistics for a dashboard. The `viewer` field and all view-count fields (`total_views`, `viewed_at`, `total_views_by_type`) are populated only when Real User Monitoring (RUM) is active for the org.
---@class datadog.v2.DashboardUsageAttributes
---@field author? datadog.v2.DashboardUsageUser|distilled.Null
---@field created_at? string|distilled.Null When the dashboard was created.
---@field dashboard_quality_score? number|distilled.Null The dashboard quality score ranges from 0 to 1, with higher scores indicating stronger signals of quality and usefulness. The value is `null` when no score is available. The score considers the following factors: - Dashboard and widget naming, including whether the dashboard uses a default or templated name - The number of data widgets, excluding container and text widgets - Confirmed broken queries - Recent activity, based on the last view date or, when no view date is available, the last edit or creation date Dashboards linked from monitors do not receive lower scores because of their naming or lack of recent activity. An age-based adjustment helps prevent newly created dashboards from receiving disproportionately low scores. Queries lower the score only when confirmed broken.
---@field edited_at? string|distilled.Null When the dashboard was most recently edited.
---@field org_id number The Datadog organization that owns the dashboard.
---@field teams? datadog.v2.DashboardUsageAttributesTeamsList|distilled.Null Teams the dashboard is tagged with.
---@field title? string The dashboard title.
---@field total_views? number Total view count for the dashboard. Counts only views captured by Real User Monitoring (RUM); `0` in orgs without RUM.
---@field total_views_by_type? datadog.v2.DashboardUsageAttributesTotalViewsByTypeMap|distilled.Null View counts keyed by view type (`in_app`, `embed`, `public`, `shared`, `api`, `unknown`). Counts only views captured by Real User Monitoring (RUM); empty in orgs without RUM.
---@field viewed_at? string|distilled.Null When the dashboard was most recently viewed. Populated only when Real User Monitoring (RUM) is active for the org; `null` in orgs without RUM.
---@field viewer? datadog.v2.DashboardUsageUser|distilled.Null
---@field widget_count? number|distilled.Null The total number of widgets on the dashboard.
---@field widget_count_by_type? datadog.v2.DashboardUsageAttributesWidgetCountByTypeMap|distilled.Null Widget counts keyed by widget type. The map includes group widgets and widgets without requests.

---Teams the dashboard is tagged with.
---@alias datadog.v2.DashboardUsageAttributesTeamsList string[]

---View counts keyed by view type (`in_app`, `embed`, `public`, `shared`, `api`, `unknown`). Counts only views captured by Real User Monitoring (RUM); empty in orgs without RUM.
