---@field available_slots? number Number of additional deletion requests the current organization can create before reaching the concurrency limit. Requests with a `pending`, `in_progress`, or `deleting` status count toward the limit. This field is returned only when listing deletion requests, and is omitted if the value cannot be determined.
---@field count_product? datadog.v2.DataDeletionResponseMetaCountProductMap The total deletion requests created by product.
---@field count_status? datadog.v2.DataDeletionResponseMetaCountStatusMap The total deletion requests created by status.
---@field max_concurrent_requests? number Maximum number of deletion requests with a `pending`, `in_progress`, or `deleting` status that the current organization can have at the same time. This field is returned only when listing deletion requests, and is omitted if the value cannot be determined.
---@field next_page? string The next page when searching deletion requests created in the current organization.
---@field product? string The product of the deletion request.
---@field request_status? string The status of the executed request.

