---@field key string Assignment value. Datadog flag variant keys are server-owned.
---@field name? string|distilled.Null Display name. Datadog flag variant names are server-owned.
---@field weight number Traffic allocation percentage. Existing variant weights cannot change through the public API after the experiment starts.

