---@alias datadog.v2.FlakyTestHistoryPolicyMetaConfigTestServicesList string[]

---The impact level of the flaky test, derived from its impact score.
---@alias datadog.v2.FlakyTestImpactLevel "low"|"medium"|"high"

---CI pipeline related statistics for the flaky test. This information is only available if test runs are associated with CI pipeline events from CI Visibility.
---@class datadog.v2.FlakyTestPipelineStats
---@field failed_pipelines? number|distilled.Null The number of pipelines that failed due to this test for the past 7 days. This is computed as the sum of failed CI pipeline events associated with test runs where the flaky test failed.
---@field total_lost_time_ms? number|distilled.Null The total time lost by CI pipelines due to this flaky test in milliseconds. This is computed as the sum of the duration of failed CI pipeline events associated with test runs where the flaky test failed.

---Metadata about the latest failed test run of the flaky test.
---@class datadog.v2.FlakyTestRunMetadata
---@field duration_ms? number|distilled.Null The duration of the test run in milliseconds.
---@field error_message? string|distilled.Null The error message from the test failure.
---@field error_stack? string|distilled.Null The stack trace from the test failure.
---@field source_end? number|distilled.Null The line number where the test ends in the source file.
---@field source_file? string|distilled.Null The source file where the test is defined.
---@field source_start? number|distilled.Null The line number where the test starts in the source file.

---Test statistics for the flaky test.
---@class datadog.v2.FlakyTestStats
---@field failure_rate_pct? number|distilled.Null The failure rate percentage of the test for the past 7 days. This is the number of failed test runs divided by the total number of test runs (excluding skipped test runs).

---The type of the flaky test from Flaky Test Management.
---@alias datadog.v2.FlakyTestType "flaky_test"

