---@field next_page? string|distilled.Null Cursor for the next page of results.

---Search filter settings.
---@class datadog.v2.FlakyTestsSearchFilter
---@field include_history? boolean Whether to include the status change history for each flaky test in the response. When set to true, each test will include a `history` array with chronological status changes. Defaults to false.
---@field query? string Search query following log syntax used to filter flaky tests, same as on Flaky Tests Management UI. The supported search keys are: - `flaky_test_state` - `flaky_test_category` - `@test.name` - `@test.suite` - `@test.module` - `@test.service` - `@git.repository.id_v2` - `@git.branch` - `@test.codeowners` - `env` - `fingerprint_fqn` Use `fingerprint_fqn` to filter by a test's stable Fingerprint FQN (the same value as the test's `id`).

