---A single configuration file operation to perform on the target hosts.
---@class datadog.v2.FleetDeploymentOperation
---@field file_op datadog.v2.FleetDeploymentFileOp|string
---@field file_path string Absolute path to the target configuration file on the host.
---@field patch? datadog.v2.FleetDeploymentOperationPatchMap Patch data in JSON format to apply to the configuration file. When using `merge-patch`, this object is merged with the existing configuration, allowing you to add, update, or override specific fields without replacing the entire file. The structure must match the target configuration file format (for example, YAML structure for Datadog Agent config). Not applicable when using the `delete` operation.

