---The incident's attributes from a response.
---@class datadog.v2.IncidentResponseAttributes
---@field archived? string|distilled.Null Timestamp of when the incident was archived.
---@field case_id? number|distilled.Null The incident case id.
---@field created? string Timestamp when the incident was created.
---@field customer_impact_duration? number Length of the incident's customer impact in seconds. Equals the difference between `customer_impact_start` and `customer_impact_end`.
---@field customer_impact_end? string|distilled.Null Timestamp when customers were no longer impacted by the incident.
---@field customer_impact_scope? string|distilled.Null A summary of the impact customers experienced during the incident.
---@field customer_impact_start? string|distilled.Null Timestamp when customers began being impacted by the incident.
---@field customer_impacted? boolean A flag indicating whether the incident caused customer impact.
---@field declared? string Timestamp when the incident was declared.
---@field declared_by? datadog.v2.IncidentNonDatadogCreator|distilled.Null
---@field declared_by_uuid? string|distilled.Null UUID of the user who declared the incident.
---@field detected? string|distilled.Null Timestamp when the incident was detected.
---@field fields? datadog.v2.IncidentResponseAttributesFieldsMap A condensed view of the user-defined fields attached to incidents.
---@field incident_type_uuid? string A unique identifier that represents an incident type.
---@field is_test? boolean A flag indicating whether the incident is a test incident.
---@field modified? string Timestamp when the incident was last modified.
---@field non_datadog_creator? datadog.v2.IncidentNonDatadogCreator|distilled.Null
---@field notification_handles? datadog.v2.IncidentResponseAttributesNotificationHandlesList|distilled.Null Notification handles that will be notified of the incident during update.
---@field public_id? number The monotonically increasing integer ID for the incident.
---@field resolved? string|distilled.Null Timestamp when the incident's state was last changed from active or stable to resolved or completed.
---@field severity? datadog.v2.IncidentSeverity
---@field state? string|distilled.Null The state incident.
---@field time_to_detect? number The amount of time in seconds to detect the incident. Equals the difference between `customer_impact_start` and `detected`.
---@field time_to_internal_response? number The amount of time in seconds to call incident after detection. Equals the difference of `detected` and `created`.
---@field time_to_repair? number The amount of time in seconds to resolve customer impact after detecting the issue. Equals the difference between `customer_impact_end` and `detected`.
---@field time_to_resolve? number The amount of time in seconds to resolve the incident after it was created. Equals the difference between `created` and `resolved`.
---@field title string The title of the incident, which summarizes what happened.
---@field visibility? string|distilled.Null The incident visibility status.
---@field [string] any

