---A single content block rendered inside a `display_block` interaction.
---`type` discriminates which other fields are meaningful:
---
---- `markdown` / `text`: `content` must be a string.
---- `header`: `content` must be a string; `level`, when set, must be one of `sm`, `md`, `lg`, `xl`.
---- `json`: `content` must be a well-formed JSON value (object, array, or scalar).
---- `image`: `url` is required.
---- `univiz`: `tileDef` is required (any well-formed JSON; the frontend owns the renderable schema).
---- `llmobs_trace`: `traceId` is required; `interactionType`, when set, must be `trace` or `experiment_trace`.
---- `frontend`: `code` is required and must be a non-empty string; `label` is optional.
---
---`height`, when set, must be positive.
---@class datadog.v2.LLMObsContentBlock
---@field alt? string Alternative text for an `image` block.
---@field code? string
---@field content? any Block payload. A string for `markdown`, `header`, and `text`; an arbitrary JSON value (object, array, or scalar) for `json`. Omitted for `image`, `univiz`, `llmobs_trace`, and `frontend`.
---@field height? number Optional rendered height. Must be positive when set.
---@field interactionType? datadog.v2.LLMObsContentBlockLLMObsTraceInteractionType|string
---@field label? string Optional label rendered alongside a `frontend` block.
---@field level? datadog.v2.LLMObsContentBlockHeaderLevel|string
---@field tileDef? any Tile definition for a `univiz` block. Required for `univiz`. The schema is owned by the frontend renderer.
---@field timeFrame? datadog.v2.LLMObsContentBlockTimeFrame
---@field traceId? string Trace identifier. Required for `llmobs_trace` blocks.
---@field type? datadog.v2.LLMObsContentBlockType|string
---@field url? string URL of the image. Required for `image` blocks.

---Visual size for a `header` block.
---@alias datadog.v2.LLMObsContentBlockHeaderLevel "sm"|"md"|"lg"|"xl"

---Upstream interaction type referenced by an `llmobs_trace` block.
---Restricted to `trace` or `experiment_trace`.
---@alias datadog.v2.LLMObsContentBlockLLMObsTraceInteractionType "trace"|"experiment_trace"

---Unix-millis time range used by chart blocks.
