---@field results_updated_since? string Return only experiments whose results_last_updated is at or after this RFC3339 timestamp. results_last_updated is the later of the latest successful run completion and the latest stored result refresh. Inclusive, and excludes experiments without successful results. This filter does not include all metadata edits or deletions.
---@field search? string Find experiments whose names contain the search text, regardless of case.
