---@class datadog.v2.ListRUMRecoveryBatchRequestsRequest
---@field type datadog.v2.RumRecoveryBatchRequestType|string Must equal batch.
---@field limit? number Number of results returned per page, at most 100 (default 50). Omitted, zero, or negative values use 50. Invalid integers return 400.
---@field cursor? string Opaque next-page cursor. Keep type, from, to, and query unchanged between pages.
---@field from? number Start of the request creation-time range in Unix milliseconds, inclusive. This filters created_at, not the time range of the sessions being recovered. Must be earlier than to when both are provided.
---@field to? number End of the request creation-time range in Unix milliseconds, exclusive. This filters created_at, not the time range of the sessions being recovered. Must be later than from when both are provided.
---@field query? string Filter recovery requests whose stored query selects matching facet values. Supports facet:value and facet:(A OR B) terms combined with AND, including * and ? wildcards in filter values. Attribute facets keep their leading @. At most 4096 bytes. Exclusions, repeated facets, free text, ranges, and OR between terms return 400. Stored queries that cannot be matched unambiguously are excluded. Blank values apply no query filter.

