---@field search_by? datadog.v2.SourcemapSearchBy|string Set to `debug_id` to browse JavaScript source maps indexed by debug ID. Only supported for `mapkind=js`. Omit for service/version searches or a specific `filter[debug_id]` lookup. In debug-ID browse mode, service, version, and filename filters are not supported.
---@field mapkind? datadog.v2.SourcemapMapKind|string The type of source map. Defaults to `js`.
---@field symbol_type? datadog.v2.SourcemapSymbolType|string WASM symbol representation. Only supported for `mapkind=wasm`. Defaults to `dwarf`, which requires `filter[build_id]`. `sourcemap` requires `filter[service]` and `filter[version]`.
---@field page_after_? string Cursor for the next page of a JavaScript listing. Use the value from `meta.page.next_cursor` and keep the same search mode and filters. Omit on the first request. Not supported for other map kinds or for a specific `filter[debug_id]` lookup without `search_by=debug_id`.
---@field page_size_? number The number of results per page. Defaults to 100. Must be at least 1; values above 1000 are capped at 1000.
---@field page_number_? number Legacy page number, starting from 1. Prefer `page[after]` for JavaScript listings. Not supported with `search_by=debug_id`. Other map kinds default to page 1 when pagination parameters are omitted.
---@field filter_service_? datadog.v2.ListSourcemapsRequestFilterServiceList Filter by service names (multiple values allowed). Required for `jvm`, `react`, and `flutter` map kinds, and for `wasm` with `symbol_type=sourcemap`. Also required for `js` unless searching by `filter[debug_id]` or browsing with `search_by=debug_id`.
---@field filter_version_? datadog.v2.ListSourcemapsRequestFilterVersionList Filter by version values (multiple values allowed). Required for `jvm`, `react`, and `flutter` map kinds, and for `wasm` with `symbol_type=sourcemap`. Also required for `js` unless searching by `filter[debug_id]` or browsing with `search_by=debug_id`.
---@field filter_variant_? datadog.v2.ListSourcemapsRequestFilterVariantList Filter by variant values (multiple values allowed). Supported for `jvm`.
---@field filter_id_? datadog.v2.ListSourcemapsRequestFilterIdList Filter by source map ID values (multiple values allowed). Supported for all map kinds.
---@field filter_build_id_? datadog.v2.ListSourcemapsRequestFilterBuildIdList Filter by build ID values (multiple values allowed). Supported for `jvm`, `ndk`, `il2cpp`, `wasm`, and `portable_pdb`. Required for `wasm` with `symbol_type=dwarf`.
---@field filter_uuid_? datadog.v2.ListSourcemapsRequestFilterUuidList Filter by UUID values (multiple values allowed). Supported for `ios`.
---@field filter_platform_? datadog.v2.ListSourcemapsRequestFilterPlatformList Filter by platform values (multiple values allowed). Supported for `react`.
---@field filter_build_number_? datadog.v2.ListSourcemapsRequestFilterBuildNumberList Filter by build number values (multiple values allowed). Supported for `react`.
---@field filter_bundle_name_? datadog.v2.ListSourcemapsRequestFilterBundleNameList Filter by bundle name values (multiple values allowed). Supported for `react`.
---@field filter_arch_? datadog.v2.ListSourcemapsRequestFilterArchList Filter by architecture values (multiple values allowed). Supported for `flutter`, `elf`, and `ndk`.
---@field filter_symbol_source_? datadog.v2.ListSourcemapsRequestFilterSymbolSourceList Filter by symbol source values (multiple values allowed). Supported for `elf`.
---@field filter_origin_? datadog.v2.ListSourcemapsRequestFilterOriginList Filter by origin values (multiple values allowed). Supported for `elf`.
---@field filter_origin_version_? datadog.v2.ListSourcemapsRequestFilterOriginVersionList Filter by origin version values (multiple values allowed). Supported for `elf`.
