---@field window_seconds_? number The number of seconds of look back (from now) to query for tag data. Default value is 14400 (4 hours), minimum value is 14400 (4 hours). If you send a value below 14400, the request still succeeds, but the API uses 14400 (4 hours) instead of your value.
---@field filter_tags_? string Filter results to tags from data points that have the specified tags. For example, `filter[tags]=env:staging,host:123` returns tags only from data points with both `env:staging` and `host:123`.
---@field filter_match_? string Filter returned tags to those matching a substring. For example, `filter[match]=env` returns tags like `env:prod`, `environment:staging`, etc.
---@field filter_include_tag_values_? boolean Whether to include tag values in the response. Defaults to true.
