---@field indexed_volume? number Estimated average hourly number of indexed time series for the given metric over the last hour. For organizations on Metric Name Pricing, this represents the estimated sum of indexed data points over the last hour.
---@field indexed_volume_delta? number Change in `indexed_volume` compared with the previous hour: the last hour's value minus the value for the hour before. Negative when volume decreased.
---@field ingested_volume? number Estimated average hourly number of ingested time series for the given metric over the last hour. This value is `0` for metrics not configured with Metrics Without Limits. For organizations on Metric Name Pricing, this represents the estimated sum of ingested data points over the last hour.
---@field ingested_volume_delta? number Change in `ingested_volume` compared with the previous hour: the last hour's value minus the value for the hour before. Negative when volume decreased.

