---@field action datadog.v2.ObservabilityPipelineSensitiveDataScannerProcessorActionRedactAction|string
---@field options datadog.v2.ObservabilityPipelineSensitiveDataScannerProcessorActionRedactOptions

---Action type that completely replaces the matched sensitive data with a fixed replacement string to remove all visibility.
