---The `tag_cardinality_limit` processor caps the number of distinct tag value combinations on metrics, dropping tags or events once the limit is exceeded.
---
---**Supported pipeline types:** metrics
---@class datadog.v2.ObservabilityPipelineTagCardinalityLimitProcessor
---@field display_name? string
---@field enabled boolean Indicates whether the processor is enabled.
---@field id string The unique identifier for this component. Used in other parts of the pipeline to reference this component (for example, as the `input` to downstream components).
---@field include string A Datadog search query used to determine which metrics this processor targets.
---@field limit_exceeded_action datadog.v2.ObservabilityPipelineTagCardinalityLimitProcessorAction|string
---@field per_metric_limits? datadog.v2.ObservabilityPipelineTagCardinalityLimitProcessorPerMetricLimitsList A list of per-metric cardinality overrides that take precedence over the default `value_limit`.
---@field tracking_mode datadog.v2.ObservabilityPipelineTagCardinalityLimitProcessorTrackingMode
---@field type datadog.v2.ObservabilityPipelineTagCardinalityLimitProcessorType|string
---@field value_limit number The default maximum number of distinct tag value combinations allowed per metric.

---The action to take when the cardinality limit is exceeded.
---@alias datadog.v2.ObservabilityPipelineTagCardinalityLimitProcessorAction "drop_tag"|"drop_event"

---How the override is applied. `limit_override` enforces a custom limit; `excluded` omits the metric or tag from cardinality tracking.
---@alias datadog.v2.ObservabilityPipelineTagCardinalityLimitProcessorOverrideType "limit_override"|"excluded"

---A cardinality override applied to a specific metric.
---@class datadog.v2.ObservabilityPipelineTagCardinalityLimitProcessorPerMetricLimit
---@field limit_exceeded_action? datadog.v2.ObservabilityPipelineTagCardinalityLimitProcessorAction|string
---@field metric_name string The name of the metric this override applies to.
---@field override_type datadog.v2.ObservabilityPipelineTagCardinalityLimitProcessorOverrideType|string
---@field per_tag_limits? datadog.v2.ObservabilityPipelineTagCardinalityLimitProcessorPerMetricLimitPerTagLimitsList A list of per-tag cardinality overrides that apply within this metric. Must be omitted when `override_type` is `excluded`.
---@field value_limit? number The maximum number of distinct tag value combinations allowed for this metric. Required when `override_type` is `limit_override`. Must be omitted when `override_type` is `excluded`.

---A list of per-tag cardinality overrides that apply within this metric. Must be omitted when `override_type` is `excluded`.
---@alias datadog.v2.ObservabilityPipelineTagCardinalityLimitProcessorPerMetricLimitPerTagLimitsList datadog.v2.ObservabilityPipelineTagCardinalityLimitProcessorPerTagLimit[]

---A list of per-metric cardinality overrides that take precedence over the default `value_limit`.
---@alias datadog.v2.ObservabilityPipelineTagCardinalityLimitProcessorPerMetricLimitsList datadog.v2.ObservabilityPipelineTagCardinalityLimitProcessorPerMetricLimit[]

---A cardinality override for a specific tag key within a per-metric limit.
---@class datadog.v2.ObservabilityPipelineTagCardinalityLimitProcessorPerTagLimit
---@field override_type datadog.v2.ObservabilityPipelineTagCardinalityLimitProcessorOverrideType|string
---@field tag_key string The tag key this override applies to.
---@field value_limit? number The maximum number of distinct values allowed for this tag. Required when `override_type` is `limit_override`. Must be omitted when `override_type` is `excluded`.

---Controls whether the processor uses exact or probabilistic tag tracking.
