---@field mode datadog.v2.ObservabilityPipelineTagCardinalityLimitProcessorTrackingModeMode|string

---The cardinality tracking algorithm to use.
---@alias datadog.v2.ObservabilityPipelineTagCardinalityLimitProcessorTrackingModeMode "exact_fingerprint"|"probabilistic"

---The processor type. The value must be `tag_cardinality_limit`.
---@alias datadog.v2.ObservabilityPipelineTagCardinalityLimitProcessorType "tag_cardinality_limit"

