---@field last_updated_at? string|distilled.Null The `updated_at` value returned by a previous read, as an RFC 3339 timestamp. If it differs from the stored update time, truncated to seconds, the request returns a 409 response. For metadata-only updates, this check does not prevent all concurrent writes. This field alone does not constitute an update.
