---@field api_key_id? number ID of the API key associated with the application.
---@field apm_rum_flat_sampling_replay_enabled? boolean Indicates if flat sampling of Session Replay for APM-correlated RUM sessions is enabled.
---@field apm_rum_flat_sampling_replay_sample_rate? number Sample rate (0-100) of Session Replay for APM-correlated RUM sessions when flat sampling is enabled.
---@field application_id string ID of the RUM application.
---@field client_token string Client token of the RUM application.
---@field created_at number Timestamp in ms of the creation date.
---@field created_by_handle string Handle of the creator user.
---@field disabled_at? number Timestamp in ms of the date the RUM application was disabled. Only present if the application was disabled.
---@field disabled_by_handle? string Handle of the user who disabled the RUM application. Only present if the application was disabled.
---@field error_tracking_exclusion_filter_enabled? boolean Indicates if Error Tracking exclusion filters are enabled for the application.
---@field external_feeds? datadog.v2.RUMApplicationAttributesExternalFeedsList Non-native ingestion paths the RUM application sends its data through. `otel` means the application sends RUM data through OpenTelemetry instead of the Datadog RUM SDK.
---@field hash? string Hash of the RUM application. Optional.
---@field is_active? boolean Indicates if the RUM application is active.
