---JSON:API resource containing the cost recommendations filter. This legacy search contract
---uses the resource ID for the filter expression rather than as a persistent resource identifier.
---@class datadog.v2.RecommendationsFilterRequestData
---@field attributes? datadog.v2.RecommendationsFilterRequestDataAttributes
---@field id? string Filter expression applied to the recommendations when `attributes.filter` is omitted. When supplied, `attributes.filter` overrides this value, including when empty. If the resulting filter is empty, it defaults to `*`. Scope, view, and pagination still apply.
---@field type datadog.v2.RecommendationsFilterRequestDataType|string

---Attributes used to filter and sort cost recommendations.
---@class datadog.v2.RecommendationsFilterRequestDataAttributes
---@field filter? string Filter expression applied to the recommendations. When supplied, this attribute overrides `data.id`, including when empty. When omitted, `data.id` is used. If the resulting filter is empty, it defaults to `*`. Scope, view, and pagination still apply.
---@field scope? datadog.v2.RecommendationsFilterRequestScope|string
---@field sort? datadog.v2.RecommendationsFilterRequestDataAttributesSortList Ordered list of sort clauses applied to the result set.
---@field view? string Status view to return: `all`, `active` (not dismissed), `dismissed`, `open`, `in-progress`, or `completed`. Defaults to `all`, which returns recommendations in every status.

---Ordered list of sort clauses applied to the result set.
---@alias datadog.v2.RecommendationsFilterRequestDataAttributesSortList datadog.v2.RecommendationsFilterRequestSortItems[]

---Legacy JSON:API resource type required by the cost recommendations search decoder.
---@alias datadog.v2.RecommendationsFilterRequestDataType "recommendations_filter"

---Recommendations scope. Defaults to `ccm`; use `experiment` for experimental recommendations
---or `*` for both. An empty value is treated as `ccm`.
---@alias datadog.v2.RecommendationsFilterRequestScope "ccm"|"experiment"|"*"|""

---A single sort clause applied to the cost recommendations result set.
---@class datadog.v2.RecommendationsFilterRequestSortItems
---@field expression? string Field to sort by (for example, `@potential_daily_savings`).
---@field order string Sort direction, either `ASC` or `DESC` (case-insensitive).

