---@class datadog.v2.RestoreSourcemapsRequest
---@field mapkind datadog.v2.SourcemapMapKind|string The type of source map. Valid values are `js`, `jvm`, `ios`, `react`, `flutter`, `elf`, `ndk`, `il2cpp`, `wasm`, `portable_pdb`.
---@field symbol_type? datadog.v2.SourcemapSymbolType|string WASM symbol representation. Only supported for `mapkind=wasm`. Defaults to `dwarf`, which requires `filter[build_id]`. `sourcemap` requires `filter[service]` and `filter[version]`.
---@field dry_run boolean When set to `true`, returns the source maps that would be restored without performing the actual restoration. When set to `false`, performs the restoration.
---@field filter_service_? datadog.v2.RestoreSourcemapsRequestFilterServiceList Filter by service names (multiple values allowed). Required for `js`, `jvm`, `react`, and `flutter` map kinds, and for `wasm` with `symbol_type=sourcemap`.
---@field filter_version_? datadog.v2.RestoreSourcemapsRequestFilterVersionList Filter by version values (multiple values allowed, maximum 10). Required for `js`, `jvm`, `react`, and `flutter` map kinds, and for `wasm` with `symbol_type=sourcemap`.
---@field filter_variant_? datadog.v2.RestoreSourcemapsRequestFilterVariantList Filter by variant values (multiple values allowed). Supported for `jvm`.
---@field filter_id_? datadog.v2.RestoreSourcemapsRequestFilterIdList Filter by source map ID values (multiple values allowed). Supported for all map kinds.
---@field filter_build_id_? datadog.v2.RestoreSourcemapsRequestFilterBuildIdList Filter by build ID values (multiple values allowed). Supported for `jvm`, `ndk`, `il2cpp`, `wasm`, and `portable_pdb`. Required for `wasm` with `symbol_type=dwarf`.
---@field filter_uuid_? datadog.v2.RestoreSourcemapsRequestFilterUuidList Filter by UUID values (multiple values allowed). Supported for `ios`.
---@field filter_platform_? datadog.v2.RestoreSourcemapsRequestFilterPlatformList Filter by platform values (multiple values allowed). Supported for `react`.
---@field filter_build_number_? datadog.v2.RestoreSourcemapsRequestFilterBuildNumberList Filter by build number values (multiple values allowed). Supported for `react`.
---@field filter_bundle_name_? datadog.v2.RestoreSourcemapsRequestFilterBundleNameList Filter by bundle name values (multiple values allowed). Supported for `react`.
---@field filter_arch_? datadog.v2.RestoreSourcemapsRequestFilterArchList Filter by architecture values (multiple values allowed). Supported for `flutter`, `elf`, and `ndk`.
---@field filter_symbol_source_? datadog.v2.RestoreSourcemapsRequestFilterSymbolSourceList Filter by symbol source values (multiple values allowed). Supported for `elf`.
---@field filter_origin_? datadog.v2.RestoreSourcemapsRequestFilterOriginList Filter by origin values (multiple values allowed). Supported for `elf`.
---@field filter_origin_version_? datadog.v2.RestoreSourcemapsRequestFilterOriginVersionList Filter by origin version values (multiple values allowed). Supported for `elf`.
---@field filter_filename_? string Filter by filename (single value). Supported for `js`, `elf`, `ndk`, `wasm`, and `portable_pdb`.
---@field filter_debug_id_? string Filter by debug ID (single value). Supported for `react`.
---@field filter_gnu_build_id_? string Filter by GNU build ID (single value). Supported for `elf`.
---@field filter_go_build_id_? string Filter by Go build ID (single value). Supported for `elf`.
---@field filter_file_hash_? string Filter by file hash (single value). Supported for `elf`.

---@alias datadog.v2.RestoreSourcemapsRequestFilterArchList string[]

