---Settings for creating the Temporal Cloud OpenMetrics integration account.
---@class datadog.v2.TemporalCloudOpenMetricsIntegrationAccountSettingsRequest
---@field include_opt_in_labels? boolean When enabled, Datadog collects Temporal Cloud's [opt-in labels](https://docs.temporal.io/cloud/metrics/openmetrics/metrics-reference#opt-in-labels) (activity type, worker deployment name, and worker build ID) for more granularity on your existing metrics. Enabling them may increase metric collection latency. Defaults to `false`.
---@field namespaces_to_include? string Comma-separated list of Temporal Cloud namespaces to collect metrics for. An entry can use `*` as a wildcard. For example, `prod-*` matches every namespace starting with `prod-`. Entries may contain only lowercase letters, digits, hyphens, periods, and `*`. Any other value is rejected with a `422` response. Omit this field or leave it empty to collect metrics for all namespaces.

---Settings configured on the Temporal Cloud OpenMetrics integration account.
