---@field namespaces_to_include? string Comma-separated list of Temporal Cloud namespaces to collect metrics for. An entry can use `*` as a wildcard. For example, `prod-*` matches every namespace starting with `prod-`. Empty or absent when metrics are collected for all namespaces.

