---@field namespaces_to_include? string Comma-separated list of Temporal Cloud namespaces to collect metrics for. An entry can use `*` as a wildcard. For example, `prod-*` matches every namespace starting with `prod-`. Entries may contain only lowercase letters, digits, hyphens, periods, and `*`. Any other value is rejected with a `422` response. Omit this field or leave it empty to collect metrics for all namespaces.

