---@field pending_effective_from? string The future UTC month when the scheduled limit takes effect, formatted as `YYYY-MM`, starting at 00:00 UTC on its first day. Present only together with `pending_usage_limit` and omitted when no change is scheduled.
---@field pending_usage_limit? number The usage limit scheduled for the organization-wide quota in the usage units defined by the quota namespace. A value of `0` is valid. At the start of the effective month, this value becomes `usage_limit` and both pending fields are omitted. Omitted when no change is scheduled.
---@field scope? datadog.v2.UsageQuotaResponseScope
