---@alias datadog.v2.UsageQuotaResponseScope { [string]: string }

---The JSON:API resource type for a usage quota.
---@alias datadog.v2.UsageQuotaType "quotas"

---Attributes to update on a usage quota. At least one of `usage_limit`, `enforced`, or `pending_usage_limit` must be provided. Omitting a property leaves its current value unchanged.
---@class datadog.v2.UsageQuotaUpdateAttributes
---@field enforced? boolean|distilled.Null Whether to actively block usage above the limit. Omit this field to leave the current enforcement setting unchanged.
---@field pending_usage_limit? number|distilled.Null The non-negative, whole-number limit to schedule for the organization-wide quota in the usage units defined by the quota namespace. It is not checked against current usage. Each write schedules the value for 00:00 UTC on the first day of the next calendar month and replaces any previously scheduled change; the server computes `pending_effective_from`. Omit this field to leave any scheduled change unchanged, including when raising `usage_limit`; use `DELETE /api/v2/usage/quotas/{quota_namespace}/{id}/pending` to cancel one.
---@field usage_limit? number|distilled.Null The new quota limit in the usage units defined by the quota namespace. For an organization-wide quota (empty scope), the limit must be greater than the usage already recorded in the current period. Omit this field to leave the current limit unchanged.

